  "an10.29:0.3": "<p>See also: <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn1'>MN 1</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn13'>MN 13–14</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn102'>MN 102</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn106'>MN 106</a></p>",
